WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:11.630
7. Internet Gossip Websites. Gossip has existed as long as humans have

2
00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:18.030
lived together. We have always gossiped about our friends and family, but we will even sometimes

3
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:24.530
gossip about people we have never met. Recently, the Internet has become a home for thousands

4
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:30.110
of celebrity gossip websites, websites that constantly update readers about the actions

5
00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:36.610
of their favorite, or least favorite, celebrities. Through these websites, rumors can be spread

6
00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:44.350
to millions of people almost instantly. Often, this gossip is unkind. Often, it can also

7
00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:48.910
be untrue. Whether it's true or not, information that

8
00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:56.650
spreads so far and so fast can be very damaging to a celebrity's career. Because of this,

9
00:00:56.650 --> 00:01:03.550
many celebrities hate these websites. They say the websites invade their privacy. Some

10
00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:09.390
celebrities have sued the websites or writers of the sites. Many of these lawsuits have

11
00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:15.370
been successful, meaning the websites have been forced to correct false stories or pay

12
00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:22.070
money to celebrities. But other celebrities encourage gossip websites. They believe all

13
00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:28.570
publicity is good publicity. Some of them even work with the paparazzi, photographers

14
00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:35.190
who follow celebrities, to make sure the paparazzi will know where they are and take pictures

15
00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:42.050
of them. They feel they must remain in the public eye in order to remain popular. In

16
00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:48.850
this way, some celebrities and gossip websites form a cycle. The celebrities feed the paparazzi

17
00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:55.290
by posing for photos. Then, the paparazzi feed the photos to gossip websites, and the

18
00:01:55.290 --> 00:02:01.790
gossip websites feed the photos to consumers. Consumers see the photos and then want even

19
00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:07.930
more information about the celebrities. This, of course, means the celebrities will continue

20
00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:14.650
to pose, and the paparazzi will continue to take photos. But in the end, it isn't the

21
00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:20.830
paparazzi or celebrities who are the reason for these websites. We average human beings

22
00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:25.530
and our hunger for gossip are the reason these websites still exist.
